commit 49ccf4933e2cdc290333fd416135cad7ef6b6d8f
Author: oojuro developers
Date:   Tue Oct 20 16:21:29 2026 -0400

    Archive option: P-frames (zstd prefix = raw body of the most-referenced I-frame)
    
    Roles are fixed before compression (a P-frame's reference is never a
    P-candidate), both encodings are tried in parallel and the P-frame is kept
    when >= 3% smaller and verified against its reference. Reads decode at most
    one extra frame through the cache. Off by default (Options::pframes).

